# CSS and HTML are hand-formatted here, deliberately.
#
# The stylesheets write many rules one-per-line so a section block reads as a
# table of related values; Prettier explodes each into multiple lines and the
# comparison is lost. index.html carries comment banners and indentation that
# mark the section structure of the page.
#
# Prettier owns the JavaScript, where consistency matters more than layout.
*.css
*.html
